    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> to convert arbitrary input into domain classes managed\nby Spring Data <a href=\"../CrudRepository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>CrudRepository</code></a>s. The implementation uses a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> in turn to convert the\nsource type into the domain class' id type which is then converted into a domain class object by using a\n<a href=\"../CrudRepository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>CrudRepository</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将任意输入转换为由 Spring Data 管理的领域类，使用 <a href=\"../CrudRepository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>CrudRepository</code></a>s。该实现转而使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 将源类型转换为领域类的 ID 类型，然后使用 <a href=\"../CrudRepository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>CrudRepository</code></a> 将其转换为领域类对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
